# Collision parameters for "collide table"
#
# This file is a VSS parameter file with additional "table" directive lines.
#
# The VSS parameters are required for every species.  They are used for any
# species pair without a table, by the React styles and by compute lambda/grid
# via Collide::extract(), and by the "extrap vss" option in a table file.
#
# diameter (m)
# omega
# tref
# alpha

Ar   4.11e-10 0.81  273.15  1.4

# tabulated total cross section for a species pair:
#   <species1> <species2> table <filename> <keyword>
#
# ar_ar.tab was generated from the VHS parameters above with
#   tools/tabulate_cross_section.py, so this run must reproduce
#   "collide vss air ar.vss" to within the interpolation error

Ar Ar   table   ar_ar.tab   AR_AR_VHS
